v0.3.0

  * rewrite as a C/ncurses program; no longer needs dialog
  + filter the listing as you type ('/' to search)
  + delete saved bookmarks ('d')
  + Backspace moves up to the parent directory
  + give a starting directory as the first argument
  + key-binding help inside the program ('?')
  + colorized display
  * store bookmarks in $XDG_DATA_HOME/menucd (migrated from ~/.menucd-save)

v0.2.3 / 2023-07-25

  * add more help related to saving the PWD
  * hide '..' when in '/'
  * move saved list to the top and use separators
  * use more specific text in labels

v0.2.2 / 2023-07-25

  + output version; exit if '-v' is given as an argument
  - remove '.' from directory listings
  + add missing information to README

v0.2.1 / 2023-07-24

  * Implement menu using dialog program
  + Implement "save" feature that saves a directory to a save file
